# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Region palette (NOD-149).
#
# Named after the SKIN REGION rather than the colour, so a weapon's .obj says
# `usemtl BodyPink` on its Body and the mapping survives a palette change. The
# five above are the older colour-named set, kept because AssaultRifle_1 still
# references them.
#
# STAND-IN VALUES. Sampled from the delivered renders to match, so the assets
# import in colour instead of default grey. If Cowork's own pinkpanic.mtl has
# different numbers, that file wins — overwrite this block with it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

